      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Antwerp became one of western Europe's greatest industrial centres thanks to cloth, tapestry, silk, sugar refineries, and diamond trade.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
